# Agent output directory.
# Review/analysis/repair/verify agents write JSON here:
#   security-findings.json
#   adversarial-findings.json
#   bloat-findings.json
#   efficiency-findings.json
#   repair-log.json
#   final-verification.json
# (plus optional semgrep.json / trivy.json from security-reviewer)
#
# Transient result files are git-ignored (see root .gitignore);
# only this placeholder is tracked so the directory exists.
